2. What Are Cookies
Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website.
They help websites function properly, remember preferences, and understand how users interact with the site.

Cookies may be:

Session cookies (deleted when you close your browser)

Persistent cookies (remain until they expire or are deleted)

First‑party cookies (set by the Studio)

Third‑party cookies (set by external services we use)

